<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <%- include('../../../partials/platform/head.ejs', {
      title: "Smart Insurance: find out what cover you actually need | JobsDoor360",
      description: "Answer six quick questions and see which insurance you need (health, term or motor) and why. Free, and nobody will call you.",
      canonical: "https://jobsdoor360.in/smart-decisions/insurance/",
    }) -%>
  </head>
  <body class="sd-body" data-ga-module="smart_insurance">
    <%- include('../../../partials/platform/navbar.ejs', { path: "/smart-decisions/insurance/" }) -%>
    <main id="main">
      <header class="sd-hero" data-ga-section="hero">
        <div class="sd-wrap">
          <nav class="sd-crumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb" data-ga-section="breadcrumb"><a href="/" data-ga-event="nav_click" data-ga-name="breadcrumb_home">Home</a><span>/</span><a href="/smart-decisions/" data-ga-event="nav_click" data-ga-name="breadcrumb_smart_decisions">Smart Decisions</a><span>/</span><span aria-current="page" style="opacity:1;margin:0">Insurance</span></nav>
          <span class="sd-pill">FREE · NO SALES CALLS · ABOUT 1 MINUTE</span>
          <h1>What insurance do you actually need?</h1>
          <p>Most agents pitch a policy before they understand you. We do it the other way round. Tell us about your situation and we'll tell you which cover matters, and why.</p>
        </div>
      </header>
      <div class="sd-wrap sd-section">
        <section class="sd-panel" id="sd-form-card" data-ga-section="form">
          <h2 class="sd-section-title">Your free needs check</h2>
          <p class="sd-section-sub">Takes about a minute. We don't ask for your name or number.</p>
          <form id="sd-insurance-form" novalidate>
            <div id="sd-insurance-fields"></div>
            <p class="sd-note sd-hidden" id="sd-form-error" role="alert" style="color:#b42318;text-align:left">Please answer every question so we can give you a proper answer.</p>
            <div class="sd-btn-row" style="justify-content: flex-end">
              <button class="sd-btn sd-btn-primary" type="submit" data-ga-name="insurance_submit">Show what I need</button>
            </div>
          </form>
        </section>
        <section class="sd-panel sd-hidden" id="sd-result-card" data-ga-section="result" aria-live="polite">
          <div class="sd-result-head">
            <span class="sd-badge">Your needs check</span>
            <h2 class="sd-section-title" id="sd-result-title" tabindex="-1">Here's the cover that fits your situation</h2>
            <p class="sd-section-sub">General guidance based on your answers. We're not selling you a policy.</p>
          </div>
          <div id="sd-recos"></div>
          <div class="sd-upsell" data-ga-section="upsell">
            <h3>Compare real policies side by side</h3>
            <p>Claim settlement ratios, exclusions, waiting periods and complaint history for the plans that match you.</p>
            <div class="sd-price">₹99 – ₹199</div>
            <a class="sd-btn sd-btn-green" href="/request-received/?for=insurance_comparison" data-ga-event="upsell_click" data-ga-name="insurance_comparison_cta" data-ga-product="insurance_comparison" data-ga-price="99-199">Unlock the detailed comparison</a>
            <small>One-time unlock.</small>
            <a class="sd-upsell-alt" href="/request-received/?for=insurance_expert_call" data-ga-event="upsell_click" data-ga-name="insurance_expert_call_cta" data-ga-product="insurance_expert_call" data-ga-price="499-999">Or talk to an insurance adviser (₹499 – ₹999 per session) →</a>
          </div>
          <div class="sd-handoff" data-ga-section="next_step">Buying a home soon? <a href="/smart-decisions/investment/" data-ga-name="insurance_to_investment">Check property prices first →</a></div>
          <%# Sign-in prompt switched OFF: results pages no longer send people to
              the login page. To bring it back, move the block below out of this
              comment and uncomment the matching lines in the page's script.js.

          <div class="sd-handoff sd-hidden" id="sd-signin-hint" data-ga-section="signup_prompt">
            Want a reminder when it's time to renew?
            <a id="sd-signin-link" href="/login/" data-ga-event="signup_prompt_click" data-ga-name="insurance_signup_prompt">Create a free profile →</a>
          </div>
          -%>
          <div class="sd-btn-row" style="justify-content: center">
            <button type="button" class="sd-btn sd-btn-ghost" id="sd-restart" data-ga-name="form_start_over">Start over</button>
            <a class="sd-btn sd-btn-primary" href="/smart-decisions/" data-ga-name="see_all_smart_decisions">See all Smart Decisions</a>
          </div>
        </section>
      </div>
    </main>
    <%- include('../../../partials/platform/footer.ejs') -%>
    <script type="module" src="/staticfiles/db/dbconfig.js"></script>
    <script type="module" src="/staticfiles/mainfiles/smart-decisions/insurance/script.js?v=<%= platform_version %>"></script>
  </body>
</html>
